{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Reaper Harvest Time preserves Soul Infusion at 50%, not always",
  "contract": [
    "Harvest Time 803995 promises 50% Soul Infusion preservation during its 15-second buff (SpellDuration 8).",
    "Soulslam 504014 requires Soul Infusion 803031 and uses native melee hit resolution. Melee hit and expertise",
    "control avoided casts. CoA.AutoProgression is off by default, so Soulslam must be learned explicitly.",
    "Four normal Harvest Time cast windows sample eight normal Soulslam casts each at 1600ms intervals.",
    "Reset Harvest Time cooldown between windows only for bounded sampling. Assert the buff before every trial",
    "so the sample never includes unbuffed casts after its 15-second expiry.",
    "All 32 Soulslam casts must succeed and hit. Remover 561290 must occur between 1 and 31 times: always",
    "preserving yields zero and always consuming yields 32. A 50% chance fails either bound with probability 2^-31."
  ],
